<!-- Part 14 e2e scenario 2/5: plain inheritance, no override (§9's simple
     case). BaseType declares a Mandatory component "Drive" : DriveType.
     SubType <: BaseType declares nothing of its own.

     Expect:
       VT(BaseType, "Drive") rdfs:subClassOf opcua:DriveType only.
       VT(SubType, "Drive")  rdfs:subClassOf opcua:DriveType (§8, unchanged)
                             AND rdfs:subClassOf VT(BaseType, "Drive") (§9).
     DriveType itself has no declarations of its own (a leaf type), and
     SubType has no own definer node at all, both edge cases exercised by
     the unit tests, now proven through the real nodeset2owl.py pipeline too. -->
